/* ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
   Course 4 · The Sermon on the Mount
   Twelve weeks slowly through Matthew 5–7.

   Prerequisites: Foundations, The Story of God, Disciplines.
   The previous three courses gave the believer: who God is, where
   the Story goes, and how to walk the disciplines. Now Jesus
   Himself, in His longest recorded sermon, paints the portrait of
   kingdom life. A believer who has walked the disciplines is ready
   to be cut deeper by the Beatitudes and the antitheses.
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */

