      "This matters because some Christians have wanted to keep just the New Testament and discard the Old. Jesus refuses that move. 'Not one jot or tittle' will pass from the Law until all is accomplished. The God who spoke to Moses is the God who speaks in Jesus. The whole Bible is His Word, and the whole Bible points to His Son.",
